{"last_link_id": 738, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["# Qwen Image 2.1 · 单图/双图/多图总控\n\n## 使用方法\n\n1. **图1固定为编辑目标**，始终启用。\n2. 顶部红色控制台中，每个按钮对应一张参考图。\n3. 所有参考图默认关闭：此时就是单图编辑。\n4. 打开“参考图2”：变成双图编辑；继续打开即可变成多图编辑。\n5. 提示词中使用 `<image1>`、`<image2>`……明确每张图的职责。\n\n不要打开没有选择有效图片的参考图开关。\n\n## 官方参数\n\n- Steps：40-50\n- CFG：1\n- Sampler：Euler\n- Scheduler：Simple\n- Negative Prompt：空\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "快速使用", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [450, 650], "pos": [0, 570], "id": 463, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "images", "label": "images", "dir": 4, "type": "IMAGE"}, {"shape": 3, "name": "images", "label": "images", "dir": 4, "type": "IMAGE"}], "size": [782.2222290039062, 1286.9444580078125], "pos": [4281.9443359375, 44.814842224121094], "widgets_values": [[{"name": "A", "selected": true, "url": "/view?filename=rgthree.compare._temp_csnba_00005_rdfmy_1789960909.jpg&type=temp&subfolder=&rand=0.7559107982741305&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiIzY2JjZDU2MDY1YmY0YTMwNDkyMzY0YjI3OTk2OTM0ZCIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3OTA1NjQyNTk5NDYsInRzIjoxNzg5OTU5NDU5OTQ2LCJzaWduIjoiYmRkYmUyMzFhYzNlZDU4OWQ4NzM4ZjljNTdlNzI2MmQifQ==&Rh-Identify=3cbcd56065bf4a30492364b27996934d"}, {"name": "B", "selected": true, "url": "/view?filename=rgthree.compare._temp_csnba_00006_gfdvl_1789960911.jpg&type=temp&subfolder=&rand=0.6081605450888526&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiIzY2JjZDU2MDY1YmY0YTMwNDkyMzY0YjI3OTk2OTM0ZCIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3OTA1NjQyNTk5NDYsInRzIjoxNzg5OTU5NDU5OTQ2LCJzaWduIjoiYmRkYmUyMzFhYzNlZDU4OWQ4NzM4ZjljNTdlNzI2MmQifQ==&Rh-Identify=3cbcd56065bf4a30492364b27996934d"}]], "inputs": [{"name": "image_a", "link": 707, "label": "image_a", "dir": 3, "type": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "image_b", "link": 738, "label": "image_b", "dir": 3, "type": "IMAGE"}], "flags": {}, "id": 472, "type": "Image Comparer (rgthree)", "title": "对比", "properties": {"cnr_id": "rgthree-comfy", "ver":