ets_values": ["# custom_size 与像素说明\n\n## custom_size 关闭\n\n- 最终画布跟随 **图1** 的尺寸与宽高比。\n- 宽高会对齐到 32 的倍数。\n- 下方“分辨率选择器”不参与最终尺寸。\n\n## custom_size 开启\n\n- 最终画布由“分辨率选择器”的 **比例＋像素量** 决定。\n- 建议选择接近图1的宽高比，否则编辑内容可能发生位移或重新构图。\n\n## 像素量是什么\n\n这里的 MP 是**宽×高的总像素预算**，不是单边长度：\n\n- 1MP、1:1 ≈ `1024 × 1024`\n- 1MP、4:3 ≈ `1184 × 896`\n- 1MP、3:2 ≈ `1248 × 832`\n- 1MP、16:9 ≈ `1376 × 768`\n\n由于宽高按 32 对齐，实际总像素会与目标 MP 略有差异。\n\n补充：子图里的 `resolution = 0` 控制的是参考图编码尺寸，表示尽量保持原图；如果指定分辨率如1280直接填写即可。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "尺寸说明 · custom_size / 像素", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#111827", "size": [450, 590], "pos": [2.62456723021387e-13, 1282.08544921875], "id": 491, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [688], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [444.24755859375, 94.41840362548828], "pos": [1942.0701904296875, 28.532718658447266], "widgets_values": ["qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {}, "id": 451, "type": "UNETLoader", "title": "① 加载 Qwen Image 2.1 扩散模型", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors", "directory": "diffusion_models", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors"}], "ver": "0.36.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"weight_dtype": true, "unet_name": true}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [721], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [405.6150207519531, 106], "pos": [2446.1015625, 25.9257869720459], "widgets_values": 